---

<section id="founder-cta-section" class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
	<!-- Ambient Center Glow -->
	<div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[650px] h-[350px] bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

	<!-- Content Container Centered Directly on Page (No enclosing card) -->
	<div class="relative z-10 w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center space-y-6 mx-auto">
		<!-- Overline Standard Matching Other Pages -->
		<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-blue-300 uppercase">
			<span class="w-6 h-[2px] bg-blue-300"></span>
			EXPANSIÓN NACIONAL
			<span class="w-6 h-[2px] bg-blue-300"></span>
		</div>

		<!-- Title Matching AIS Standard -->
		<h2
			class="text-[34px] sm:text-[44px] md:text-[50px] font-black text-white leading-tight tracking-tight text-center max-w-3xl"
		>
			¿Tu universidad aún no tiene un <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
			<span class="text-blue-300 text-glow-blue">Capítulo AIS</span>?
		</h2>

		<!-- Description Matching AIS Standard -->
		<p class="text-gray-400 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl text-center mx-auto">
			Conviértete en el líder estudiantil que represente a la Artificial Intelligence Society en tu casa de estudios. Impulsa grupos de estudio, proyectos de alto impacto e investigaciones con respaldo nacional.
		</p>

		<!-- Action CTA Button (Disabled - Coming Soon) -->
		<div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-center w-full">
			<button
				id="open-founder-form-btn"
				type="button"
				disabled
				aria-disabled="true"
				class="px-8 py-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-gray-400 bg-[#0E1626] border border-blue-500/20 rounded-none uppercase cursor-not-allowed opacity-75 select-none inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
			>
				POSTULA PRONTO
			</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
